BT /F1 11 Tf 50 419 Td (The monthly fee includes robot hardware, charging stations, preventive maintenance, spares,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 403 Td (    software updates, 24x7 remote monitoring and on-site response within 4 hours in our 12) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 387 Td (    service cities. Pick stations, pod shelving and site civil works are quoted separately as) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 371 Td (    one-time charges, typically INR 3.5-6 lakh per pick station and INR 18,000 per pod.) Tj ET
