BT /F1 11 Tf 50 240 Td (- Minimum term: 36 months. A 48-month term earns an additional 4% reduction on the robot) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 224 Td (    fee.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 208 Td (  - Refundable security deposit equal to two months of robot fees.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 192 Td (  - Billing monthly in advance; net 30 payment terms.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 176 Td (  - Annual escalation of 5% from month 13, capped at CPI plus 2% for enterprise accounts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 160 Td (- Robot availability guarantee of 98.5%, measured monthly. Each 1% shortfall earns a 5%) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 144 Td (    credit on that month's robot fees, capped at 20%.) Tj ET
