BT /F1 11 Tf 50 410 Td (Before proposing RaaS, confirm that the customer:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 378 Td (1. Has a committed site with a signed lease or ownership, and floor flatness suitable for) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 362 Td (    AMRs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 346 Td (2. Ships at least 8,000 order lines per day, or has a funded plan to reach that within 12) Tj ET
