BT /F1 11 Tf 50 314 Td (3. Has named a project owner at Head of Warehousing level or above.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 298 Td (4. Accepts LaneFlow as the controlling WMS, or agrees to a scoped integration \(additional) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 282 Td (    INR 12-20 lakh\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 50 231 Td (Positioning guidance) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 199 Td (Lead with outcomes, not robot counts: throughput per picker, cost per order and the ability) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 183 Td (    to scale for peaks without capex. Compare RaaS against the customer's current cost of) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 167 Td (    temporary labour and overtime during festive periods; in most D2C sites the payback against) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 151 Td (    a manual operation is 14 to 20 months. Recently funded brands and 3PLs opening new) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 135 Td (    fulfilment centres are the most receptive, because RaaS keeps investor capital free for) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 50 119 Td (    growth.) Tj ET
